IMPORTANT NOTICE — UNOFFICIAL THIRD-PARTY CLIENT

This interface-kit is an unofficial, reverse-engineered API client for
AllinCMS/LAICMS (a third-party SaaS platform). It is NOT affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supported by AllinCMS or LAICMS.

- Server Action IDs (42-hex) are extracted from the platform's public
  JavaScript bundles and are bound to specific deployment versions.
- The platform may change these IDs or schemas at any time without notice.
- Users are responsible for complying with the platform's Terms of Service.
- No warranty is provided for platform behavior, data integrity, or
  continued operation of these APIs.

For platform update recovery, see API-DISCOVERY.md.
